{
  "id": "PSA.49",
  "number": "49",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 49",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, A Psalm for the sons of Korah.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this, all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "people; give ear, all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inhabitants of the world:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Both low and high, rich and poor, together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My mouth shall speak of wisdom; and the meditation of my heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will incline mine ear to a parable: I will open my dark saying upon the harp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore should I fear in the days of evil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the iniquity of my heels shall compass me about?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They that trust in their wealth, and boast themselves in the multitude of their riches;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "can by any means redeem his brother, nor give to God a ransom for him:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(For the redemption of their soul",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "precious, and it ceaseth for ever:)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That he should still live for ever,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not see corruption.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he seeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wise men die, likewise the fool and the brutish person perish, and leave their wealth to others.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their inward thought",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is, that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their houses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall continue",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for ever,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their dwelling places to all generations; they call",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lands after their own names.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in honour abideth not: he is like the beasts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "perish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This their way",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.49.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.49.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their folly: yet their posterity approve their sayings. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like sheep they are laid in the grave; death shall feed on them; and the upright shall have dominion over them in the morning; and their beauty shall consume in the grave from their dwelling.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God will redeem my soul from the power of the grave: for he shall receive me. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not thou afraid when one is made rich, when the glory of his house is increased;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For when he dieth he shall carry nothing away: his glory shall not descend after him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though while he lived he blessed his soul: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
